    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOATS BOATS BOATS \u26f5 </h2><br>You step into the shoes of a master harbor manager\u2014well, almost. Your task is to navigate a fleet of ships safely to their docks while avoiding the chaos that comes with running a bustling maritime hub.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167940/extras/6f3fda701b276cdedf2a293ccb37fc84.poster.avif?t=1740644670\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167940/extras/6f3fda701b276cdedf2a293ccb37fc84.webm?t=1740644670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167940/extras/6f3fda701b276cdedf2a293ccb37fc84.mp4?t=1740644670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Simply draw paths to guide each ship to its destination, ensuring smooth sailing\u2014or as close as you can get.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167940/extras/667b39be619d6e15cc386db6ecd55a1f.avif?t=1740644670\" width=608 height=350 /></span><br><br>But docking ships is just the start. You\u2019ll face unexpected challenges like oil spills, drifting debris, and fishing boats. Manage the constant flow of vessels while expanding and upgrading your island into a thriving maritime empire.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Day &amp; Night Cycles: Navigate in light or darkness for added challenge.<br></li><li>Dynamic Weather: Fog, storms, and more keep you on your toes.<br></li><li>Diverse Fleet: Handle everything from tourist boats to cargo ships.<br></li><li>Strategic Challenges: Oil spills, debris, and fishing boats add complexity.<br></li><li>Upgrade System: Choose temporary boosts or permanent perks.<br></li><li>Multiple Modes: Play through missions or enjoy endless mode.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BOATS BOATS BOATS \u26f5 </h2><br>You step into the shoes of a master harbor manager\u2014well, almost. Your task is to navigate a fleet of ships safely to their docks while avoiding the chaos that comes with running a bustling maritime hub.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167940/extras/6f3fda701b276cdedf2a293ccb37fc84.poster.avif?t=1740644670\" width=608 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167940/extras/6f3fda701b276cdedf2a293ccb37fc84.webm?t=1740644670\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167940/extras/6f3fda701b276cdedf2a293ccb37fc84.mp4?t=1740644670\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Simply draw paths to guide each ship to its destination, ensuring smooth sailing\u2014or as close as you can get.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3167940/extras/667b39be619d6e15cc386db6ecd55a1f.avif?t=1740644670\" width=608 height=350 /></span><br><br>But docking ships is just the start. You\u2019ll face unexpected challenges like oil spills, drifting debris, and fishing boats. Manage the constant flow of vessels while expanding and upgrading your island into a thriving maritime empire.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Day &amp; Night Cycles: Navigate in light or darkness for added challenge.<br></li><li>Dynamic Weather: Fog, storms, and more keep you on your toes.<br></li><li>Diverse Fleet: Handle everything from tourist boats to cargo ships.<br></li><li>Strategic Challenges: Oil spills, debris, and fishing boats add complexity.<br></li><li>Upgrade System: Choose temporary boosts or permanent perks.<br></li><li>Multiple Modes: Play through missions or enjoy endless mode.</li></ul>",
